   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">SolarArizona1.jpg--Photo by Stefano Paltera/American Solar Challenge&#xD;Leader University of Missouri-Rolla (UMR) cruises at highway speed on Interstate 40 West toward the next checkpoint in Gallup, N.M. during the American Solar Challenge Sunday. UMR finished the day of racing in Peach Springs, Ariz., covering a distance of 383 miles in 9 hours after starting the day in Albuquerque.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
